    {
      "id": "p00003",
      "text": "Two\nmen dressed in blue observed him.\n\n\"Comrade,\" said one, \"here is a well-built young fellow, and of proper\nheight.\"\n\nThey went up to Candide and very civilly invited him to dinner.\n\n\"Gentlemen,\" replied Candide, with a most engaging modesty, \"you do me\ngreat honour, but I have not wherewithal to pay my share.\"",
      "translation": "Deux hommes habillés de bleu le\nremarquèrent: Camarade, dit l’un, voilà un jeune homme très bien fait,\net qui a la taille requise; ils s’avancèrent vers Candide et le\nprièrent à dîner très civilement.—Messieurs, leur dit Candide avec une\nmodestie charmante, vous me faites beaucoup d’honneur, mais je n’ai pas\nde quoi payer mon écot.—Ah!",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00001",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00004",
      "text": "\"Oh, sir,\" said one of the blues to him, \"people of your appearance and\nof your merit never pay anything: are you not five feet five inches\nhigh?\"\n\n\"Yes, sir, that is my height,\" answered he, making a low bow.",
      "translation": "monsieur, lui dit un des bleus, les\npersonnes de votre figure et de votre mérite ne paient jamais rien:\nn’avez-vous pas cinq pieds cinq pouces de haut?—Oui, messieurs, c’est\nma taille, dit-il en fesant la révérence.—Ah!",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00005",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
