    {
      "id": "p00008",
      "text": "\"Oh yes,\" answered he; \"I deeply love Miss Cunegonde.\"\n\n\"No,\" said one of the gentlemen, \"we ask you if you do not deeply love\nthe King of the Bulgarians?\"\n\n\"Not at all,\" said he; \"for I have never seen him.\"",
      "translation": "oui, répond-il, j’aime tendrement mademoiselle\nCunégonde.—Non, dit l’un de ces messieurs, nous vous demandons si vous\nn’aimez pas tendrement le roi des Bulgares?—Point du tout, dit-il, car\nje ne l’ai jamais vu.—Comment!",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00011",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
