      "text": "\"What! he is the best of kings, and we must drink his health.\"\n\n\"Oh!",
      "translation": "c’est le plus charmant des rois, et il\nfaut boire à sa santé.—Oh!",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00014",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
