    {
      "id": "p00011",
      "text": "\"That is enough,\" they tell him. \"Now you are the help, the support,\nthe defender, the hero of the Bulgarians. Your fortune is made, and your\nglory is assured.\"",
      "translation": "C’en\nest assez, lui dit-on, vous voilà l’appui, le soutien, le défenseur, le\nhéros des Bulgares; votre fortune est faite, et votre gloire est\nassurée.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00016",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00012",
      "text": "Instantly they fettered him, and carried him away to the regiment.",
      "translation": "On lui met sur-le-champ les fers aux pieds, et on le mène au\nrégiment.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00017",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00013",
      "text": "There\nhe was made to wheel about to the right, and to the left, to draw his\nrammer, to return his rammer, to present, to fire, to march, and they\ngave him thirty blows with a cudgel. The next day he did his exercise a\nlittle less badly, and he received but twenty blows. The day following\nthey gave him only ten, and he was regarded by his comrades as a\nprodigy.",
      "translation": "On le fait tourner à droite, à gauche, hausser la baguette,\nremettre la baguette, coucher en joue, tirer, doubler le pas, et on lui\ndonne trente coups de bâton; le lendemain, il fait l’exercice un peu\nmoins mal, et il ne reçoit que vingt coups; le surlendemain, on ne lui\nen donne que dix, et il est regardé par ses camarades comme un prodige.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00017",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
