    {
      "id": "p00020",
      "text": "As they were going to proceed to a third whipping,\nCandide, able to bear no more, begged as a favour that they would be so\ngood as to shoot him. He obtained this favour; they bandaged his eyes,\nand bade him kneel down.",
      "translation": "Comme on allait procéder à la troisième course, Candide, n’en pouvant\nplus, demanda en grâce qu’on voulût bien avoir la bonté de lui casser\nla tête; il obtint cette faveur; on lui bande les yeux; on le fait\nmettre à genoux.",
