    {
      "id": "p00021",
      "text": "The King of the Bulgarians passed at this\nmoment and ascertained the nature of the crime. As he had great talent,\nhe understood from all that he learnt of Candide that he was a young\nmetaphysician, extremely ignorant of the things of this world, and he\naccorded him his pardon with a clemency which will bring him praise in\nall the journals, and throughout all ages.",
      "translation": "Le roi des Bulgares passe dans ce moment, s’informe du\ncrime du patient; et comme ce roi avait un grand génie, il comprit, par\ntout ce qu’il apprit de Candide, que c’était un jeune métaphysicien\nfort ignorant des choses de ce monde, et il lui accorda sa grâce avec\nune clémence qui sera louée dans tous les journaux et dans tous les\nsiècles.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00018",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00002",
